mapping "V9174.1" source="V9174" target="215414001" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target quality=100 {
    confidence 0.03 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source V91.74 SNOMED CT 215414001 = Swedish national 5th-char extension of base ICD-10 V91.7,
        adding an activity context (vital activities: rest/sleep/meals/personal hygiene). Base code
        V91.7 (Athena id 45756203) has edge to SNOMED CT 438301 (215414001). Target 438301 is the SNOMED CT
        parent concept that subsumes V91.7. Activity suffix does not alter the clinical injury concept,
        only the context. Confidence : one-level broader, crosswalk-verified to the base code; the
        Swedish activity extension has no separate SNOMED CT representation.
        """
}
